@0    = ~Nina! I am so happy to see you! The foul Exile has returned, bringing destruction and death to our fair city!~
@1    = ~Moria, I am glad to see you as well my friend. Have you seen my father, I have not found him yet since we have entered.~
@2    = ~Nina, your father is dead. He and his party was destroyed fighting a black dragon. I'm sorry, Nina.~
@3    = ~No... NO! Where is it? Where's that damned dragon?~
@4    = ~He's in the clearing. (Moria points in the direction.) Nina, he's destroyed every party we have sent against him, he'll kill you to if you go.~
@5    = ~My father will be avenged, Moria! If I have to die trying, so be it!~
@6    = ~Lets go kill this dragon, <CHARNAME>. Please, I need your help.~
@7    = ~Of course I will help, Nina. Let's go slay this dragon.~
@8    = ~Fight a dragon? You're out of your mind!~
@9    = ~The fool was obviously weak, he got what was coming to him. I will not risk my life for your petty revenge.~
@10   = ~I wish luck to you and your friends, Nina.~
@11   = ~Thank you, Moria and thank you, <CHARNAME>, this means a lot to me.~
@12   = ~You travel with a group full of cowards, Nina?~
@13   = ~You coward! I will no longer be a part of your group any longer! I'll slay this dragon myself!~
@14   = ~You call these people your friends, Nina? ~
@15   = ~You cowardly bastard! Damn your soul for your callous remarks! I am done with you!~
